&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At CarGurus (NASDAQ: CARG), our mission is to give people the power to reach their destination. We started as a small team of developers determined to bring trust and transparency to car shopping. Since then, our history of innovation and go-to-market acceleration has driven industry-leading growth. In fact, we’re the largest and fastest-growing automotive marketplace, and we’ve been profitable for over 15 years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The market is evolving, and we are too, moving the entire automotive journey online and guiding our customers through every step. That includes everything from the sale of an old car to the financing, purchase, and delivery of a new one. Today, tens of millions of consumers visit CarGurus.com each month, and ~30,000 dealerships use our products. But they&#39;re not the only ones who love CarGurus—our employees do, too. We have a people-first culture that fosters kindness, collaboration, and innovation, and empowers our Gurus with tools to fuel their career growth. Disrupting a trillion-dollar industry requires fresh and diverse perspectives. Come join us for the ride!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CarGurus is expanding beyond software into proprietary data licensing. We are building a high-impact team to stand up and scale our Data Solutions business from zero to one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an entrepreneurial, full-cycle &lt;strong&gt;Senior Enterprise Account Executive, Data Licensing&lt;/strong&gt; to launch CarGurus’ data solutions into completely new markets such as including financial services/hedge funds, insurers, OEMs, and top-tier consultancies, while also selling into existing National Dealer accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a rare opportunity to own a brand-new revenue stream end-to-end. You will be the sole seller on a lean team, responsible for building the pipeline, scoping complex data deliveries alongside our technical analyst, and closing deals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the 0-to-1 Outbound Engine (75% Focus):&lt;/strong&gt; Prospect, map, and close new business across non-dealer verticals (Hedge Funds, Insurers, OEMs, Consultancies). This includes a mix of inbound leads and sourcing your own pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with National Accounts (25% Focus):&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with our National Account teams to identify, upsell, and close data licensing deals within existing dealership customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Cycle Deal Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the entire sales process from initial target identification, cold outreach, and discovery, through to pricing negotiation, legal contracting, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Scoping &amp;amp; Solutioning:&lt;/strong&gt; Translate client requirements (e.g., historical pricing trends, inventory flow data, consumer intent metrics) into technical data feeds. Partner directly with Analytics to scope APIs, SFTP feeds, and sample datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Feedback Loop:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the voice of the market to shape product roadmap, pricing structures, and licensing packaging in close partnership with Commercial Strategy and Business Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5+ Years of Full-Cycle Sales Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of closing 6-figure enterprise deals, ideally in data licensing, API monetization, financial data, market intelligence, or complex B2B SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven 0-to-1 Prospecting Ability:&lt;/strong&gt; Demonstrated experience sourcing your own pipeline without reliance on BDRs, SEs, or established lead routing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency in Data &amp;amp; Technical Scoping:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfort speaking the language of data (data structures, API delivery, sample evaluation) with technical buyers like quant researchers, data engineers, and strategy leads. Hands-on coding is not required, but technical fluency is essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Thrives in ambiguous environments where processes are still being built. Self-directed, scrappy, and focused on revenue execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication and negotiation skills capable of engaging C-level executives, Portfolio Managers, and Practice Leads at major institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt; Direct experience selling market data, alternative data (AltData), or industry analytics to buy-side investment firms, OEMs, or strategy consultancies. Familiarity with the automotive, mobility, or consumer transactional data ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;The displayed range represents the expected annual base salary / On-Target Earnings (OTE) for this position. On-Target Earnings (OTE) is inclusive of base salary and on-target commission earnings, which applies exclusively to sales roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Individual pay within this range is determined by work location and other factors such as job-related skills, experience, and relevant education or training.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This annual base salary forms part of a comprehensive Total Rewards Package. In addition to benefits, this role may qualify for discretionary bonuses/incentives and Restricted Stock Units (RSUs).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Position Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$152,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$190,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at CarGurus&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
